<title>USA: Southwest Bancorp stake raised by firm.</title>
<headline>Southwest Bancorp stake raised by firm.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Fidelity Assurance Corp said Wednesday it raised its stake in Southwest Bancorp Inc to 9.14 percent or 343,918 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the Oklahoma City, Okla., firm said it bought 60,000 additional shares of Southwest on Wednesday (Nov. 6) at $19 a share.</p>
<p>In a previous filing, American Fidelity said it holds its stake in the Stillwater, Okla.,-based company for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
